This dataset is a 10-row sample from EUR-Lex-Sum.

Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dennlinger/eur-lex-sum
Authors: Dennis Aumiller, Ashish Chouhan, Michael Gertz
Paper: "EUR-Lex-Sum: A Multi- and Cross-lingual Dataset for Long-form Summarization in the Legal Domain" (EMNLP 2022)
